    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490140/extras/1a9c4102aaa9af7092e556c344f78f54.poster.avif?t=1723786313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490140/extras/1a9c4102aaa9af7092e556c344f78f54.webm?t=1723786313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490140/extras/1a9c4102aaa9af7092e556c344f78f54.mp4?t=1723786313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Join Floppy the frog in a wild jumping adventure! Your mission is to reach the top without falling or rage quit halfway through. Bounce on trampolines, jump on moving platforms, and tackle quick time events.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490140/extras/2445e4dc77b36121ead79d01a45eda87.avif?t=1723786313\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><strong>Challenging Obstacles:</strong> Navigate moving platforms, trampolines, and more.<br><strong>Fun Physics:</strong> Each jump is a thrill with unpredictable outcomes.<br><strong>Humorous Dialogues:</strong> Enjoy a collection of frog-themed jokes and witty dialogues that add a light-hearted touch to your adventure.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490140/extras/1a9c4102aaa9af7092e556c344f78f54.poster.avif?t=1723786313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490140/extras/1a9c4102aaa9af7092e556c344f78f54.webm?t=1723786313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490140/extras/1a9c4102aaa9af7092e556c344f78f54.mp4?t=1723786313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Join Floppy the frog in a wild jumping adventure! Your mission is to reach the top without falling or rage quit halfway through. Bounce on trampolines, jump on moving platforms, and tackle quick time events.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490140/extras/2445e4dc77b36121ead79d01a45eda87.avif?t=1723786313\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><strong>Challenging Obstacles:</strong> Navigate moving platforms, trampolines, and more.<br><strong>Fun Physics:</strong> Each jump is a thrill with unpredictable outcomes.<br><strong>Humorous Dialogues:</strong> Enjoy a collection of frog-themed jokes and witty dialogues that add a light-hearted touch to your adventure.<br><br>",
    "short_description": "In Floppy's Great Leap, you play as Floppy the frog, aiming to reach the highest peak. Jump and climb through challenging levels in this 2D pixel art adventure. Reach the summit to make your wish, but be careful\u2014one wrong move and you could find yourself back at the bottom!",
